  "label": "Stereotype: College Degree as a Guarantee of Success",
  "description": "This is a common cultural stereotype that equates a college degree with guaranteed career success, higher income, and social mobility. The meme challenges this stereotype by contrasting the success of the speaker's parents (with only a high school diploma) with the speaker's own situation (with a 4-year degree).",
